1. Code, tokens and documentation (everything except fonts/ and brand/): the MIT
   License below.
2. The type faces in fonts/*.woff2: the SIL Open Font License 1.1. Each face's full
   licence text and copyright line is in licenses/ (Archivo: The Archivo Project
   Authors; JetBrains Mono: The JetBrains Mono Project Authors). They are the
   @fontsource-variable 5.3.0 latin and latin-ext subsets that wicked-studio already
   self-hosts.
3. The brand lockup and icons in brand/: created by the project owner for the wicked
   agile brand. The source folder they were copied from carries no licence or
   ownership note; no licence beyond this repository's is stated for them yet.

